Package: termux-xwayland-bridge
Version: 0.3.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Termux-XWayland contributors
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Depends: bash, coreutils, socat, xdotool
Description: Termux-side direct socket client for Termux-XWayland
 A small Termux package that manages Weston lifecycle and starts an app_process
 Binder FD client under the existing Termux UID. XWayland touch input is routed
 through the Binder session when xdotool is installed; native Wayland frame capture remains pending.
